</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Check description</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d317a10d-2e0e-1363-3e14-20b1a524d9c5" id="_d317a10d-2e0e-1363-3e14-20b1a524d9c5"></a>If the HDF5 attributes of &lt;QINST&gt; are different from those of &lt;FINST&gt;. If multiple &lt;FINST&gt; are present, the attributes for the bounding box, domainExtent.polygon and verticalDatum may differ.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Solution</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_7c1a9045-d82e-141d-e045-dab2e6005a37" id="_7c1a9045-d82e-141d-e045-dab2e6005a37"></a>Correct attributes of quality instance group</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Reference</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_4909026c-605a-eba8-a2bc-e3b8109e0153" id="_4909026c-605a-eba8-a2bc-e3b8109e0153"></a>PS, 10.2.5, 10.2.9</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Data quality measures</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e6e91a51-b4a8-9e89-847d-c2413872e797" id="_e6e91a51-b4a8-9e89-847d-c2413872e797"></a>Logical Consistency; Format Consistency</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Introduced</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_712e4f5a-d4ad-57d1-601e-4656f0b0430c" id="_712e4f5a-d4ad-57d1-601e-4656f0b0430c"></a>3.0.0</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Terminate if failure</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_673486c2-3029-daff-72ba-aee1d863bb7d" id="_673486c2-3029-daff-72ba-aee1d863bb7d"></a>false</p>
</td></tr></table></div>
</div>
        <div><a name="_7f2b7cec-f5d7-cb51-52ef-6cc2d26e9c04" id="_7f2b7cec-f5d7-cb51-52ef-6cc2d26e9c04"></a><h2>9.39<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>102_3010</h2>

