</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Classification</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e917919a-2530-5f79-6827-a1a7727f2abf" id="_e917919a-2530-5f79-6827-a1a7727f2abf"></a>critical_error</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Check message</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_5aa3d0af-7d37-c2ad-ca4f-9ca458aaa452" id="_5aa3d0af-7d37-c2ad-ca4f-9ca458aaa452"></a>Grid resolution out of range</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Check description</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2559f86b-78ff-2134-b42c-b2760cef5570" id="_2559f86b-78ff-2134-b42c-b2760cef5570"></a>IF ABS(numPointsLongitudinal&#x2009;&#x2014;&#x2009;1) * gridSpacingLongitudinal)&#x2009;&#x2014;&#x2009;(eastBoundLongitude&#x2009;&#x2014;&#x2009;westBoundLongitude<a><a name="_36e07f48-1fdf-86c8-cb8c-7b7871ea418f" id="_36e07f48-1fdf-86c8-cb8c-7b7871ea418f"></a></a> &gt; (0.5 * gridSpacingLongitudinal) OR ABS(numPointsLatitudinal&#x2009;&#x2014;&#x2009;1) * gridSpacingLatitudinal)&#x2009;&#x2014;&#x2009;(northBoundLatitude&#x2009;&#x2014;&#x2009;southBoundLatitude<a><a name="_692d3bbf-2465-01f5-fbea-a6ee76e30d23" id="_692d3bbf-2465-01f5-fbea-a6ee76e30d23"></a></a> &gt; (0.5 * gridSpacingLatitudinal)</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Solution</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d3ea4665-e280-a46b-7f43-63416a7625eb" id="_d3ea4665-e280-a46b-7f43-63416a7625eb"></a>Ensure that grid has correct resolution</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Reference</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d415a4fa-f576-75d9-bf2a-96ea58e810c4" id="_d415a4fa-f576-75d9-bf2a-96ea58e810c4"></a>PS, 6.2.1</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Data quality measures</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_197febac-a4a1-3308-cc0c-89c87c27c79c" id="_197febac-a4a1-3308-cc0c-89c87c27c79c"></a>Logical Consistency; Conceptual Consistency</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Introduced</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_6d1ffce5-f2f9-a8a2-2bb3-8904d248a30b" id="_6d1ffce5-f2f9-a8a2-2bb3-8904d248a30b"></a>3.0.0</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Terminate if failure</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b2eb2462-39de-8dc8-d9b0-771a8f06befa" id="_b2eb2462-39de-8dc8-d9b0-771a8f06befa"></a>false</p>
