</div>
        <div><a name="_407acf06-6cbd-d4a1-bd4d-208563e3fe5b" id="_407acf06-6cbd-d4a1-bd4d-208563e3fe5b"></a><h2>9.44<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>102_5004</h2>

<div align="left"><table class="dl"><a name="_70dc498d-d720-aa83-ef53-e5dd5e255f83" id="_70dc498d-d720-aa83-ef53-e5dd5e255f83"></a><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Dev ID</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a678740e-f562-06d9-3f96-10aadadc105e" id="_a678740e-f562-06d9-3f96-10aadadc105e"></a>102_Dev5011</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Classification</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9aa60f37-c33a-e2a0-47e8-488fe03ad384" id="_9aa60f37-c33a-e2a0-47e8-488fe03ad384"></a>error</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Check message</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_7c6ed807-f738-1f7a-2200-0cf72a4ebb37" id="_7c6ed807-f738-1f7a-2200-0cf72a4ebb37"></a>[X] interior data holes with a size less than [N] nodes were found. Review for potential data gaps.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Check description</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_34a4c19c-6a72-aab8-b005-40c3569098c3" id="_34a4c19c-6a72-aab8-b005-40c3569098c3"></a>Reports the number of interior no-data regions (&#x201C;holes&#x201D;) in &lt;FTYPE&gt; that are smaller than a specified size threshold N. This check identifies undesirable holes within the data footprint. It performs a connected components analysis on no-data cells, discards the main exterior region, and counts the remaining interior regions (&#x201C;holes&#x201D;) that have a size less than a threshold N.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Solution</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_55dc97ce-cc4c-83cd-7ca1-2862cc656919" id="_55dc97ce-cc4c-83cd-7ca1-2862cc656919"></a>(Notification only)</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Reference</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b7e8d917-f608-120f-282e-0ef405a46140" id="_b7e8d917-f608-120f-282e-0ef405a46140"></a>N/A, N/A</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Data quality measures</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_44f1ba63-abd1-c614-56b1-c65e19f5ab4a" id="_44f1ba63-abd1-c614-56b1-c65e19f5ab4a"></a>spatial object</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Introduced</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_6b890d87-1834-0fc5-6437-54f84f5b9274" id="_6b890d87-1834-0fc5-6437-54f84f5b9274"></a>3.0.0</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Terminate if failure</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_74f67251-f224-cbae-40c5-67841abf531e" id="_74f67251-f224-cbae-40c5-67841abf531e"></a>true</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Notes</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_96a1a59f-10f3-1f33-115d-107c9829a699" id="_96a1a59f-10f3-1f33-115d-107c9829a699"></a>The size threshold N should be a configurable parameter in the validation software. A sensible default could be proposed (e.g., N=10).</p>
</td></tr></table></div>
</div>
        <div><a name="_388dee27-ebac-a483-44eb-b14e31c92af9" id="_388dee27-ebac-a483-44eb-b14e31c92af9"></a><h2>9.45<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>102_5005</h2>

<div align="left"><table class="dl"><a name="_9344698b-4a37-202a-bda6-79fcf6bb2d0b" id="_9344698b-4a37-202a-bda6-79fcf6bb2d0b"></a><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Dev ID</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_603792e2-fae4-97b6-39ef-3730bbdab3aa" id="_603792e2-fae4-97b6-39ef-3730bbdab3aa"></a>102_Dev5012</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Classification</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8c380b42-d3b7-37ea-a97c-30977128c5ea" id="_8c380b42-d3b7-37ea-a97c-30977128c5ea"></a>error</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Check message</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_796d63c7-55cb-6d9d-6ecb-1faf126f5299" id="_796d63c7-55cb-6d9d-6ecb-1faf126f5299"></a>[X] isolated data groups with a size less than [N] nodes were found. Review for potential data speckling or noise.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Check description</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e6d73d4c-edc8-e306-8d26-9f0ddbd2bf17" id="_e6d73d4c-edc8-e306-8d26-9f0ddbd2bf17"></a>Reports the number of contiguous data groups in &lt;FTYPE&gt; that are smaller than a specified size threshold N. This check identifies data speckling by performing a connected components analysis to find all distinct &#x201C;islands&#x201D; of valid data cells. It then counts how many of these islands have a size less than a threshold N.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Solution</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_624dace8-81f7-5b07-ca56-28ceb66c4186" id="_624dace8-81f7-5b07-ca56-28ceb66c4186"></a>(Notification only)</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Reference</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_11827d9b-23c4-7ef5-cf2e-8435a03c1be0" id="_11827d9b-23c4-7ef5-cf2e-8435a03c1be0"></a>N/A, N/A</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Data quality measures</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_238fa0d6-006c-8f0c-b402-d4673e42cded" id="_238fa0d6-006c-8f0c-b402-d4673e42cded"></a>spatial object</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Introduced</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9a7866bb-4953-62b7-1779-da247716daa7" id="_9a7866bb-4953-62b7-1779-da247716daa7"></a>3.0.0</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Terminate if failure</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_3c41709b-32aa-f1d5-f743-326c89fdfc6d" id="_3c41709b-32aa-f1d5-f743-326c89fdfc6d"></a>true</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Notes</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_405d9550-d18a-5b8d-094a-6b1df833ff15" id="_405d9550-d18a-5b8d-094a-6b1df833ff15"></a>The size threshold N should be a configurable parameter in the validation software. Recommend a default of N=4.</p>
</td></tr></table></div>
</div>
        <div><a name="_31e54194-fb46-27ee-6de0-e23aedd2a8fd" id="_31e54194-fb46-27ee-6de0-e23aedd2a8fd"></a><h2>9.46<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>102_9001</h2>

