</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Check description</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8a20516a-2bf9-4d59-189d-9445cecb1267" id="_8a20516a-2bf9-4d59-189d-9445cecb1267"></a>IF the exchange catalogue blocks for S100_ExchangeCatalogue and S100_DatasetDiscoveryMetadata do not conform to the product-specific restrictions in the PS.</p>
