</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left"><p align="left" style="margin-left:0pt;text-align:left;" class="MsoNormal">Check description</p></td><td valign="top"><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d5f21fe6-2a50-9797-770d-35dead745d26" id="_d5f21fe6-2a50-9797-770d-35dead745d26"></a>If the dataset file size is greater than 10MB.</p>
